data.text:
O foolish one! this molded earth is naught;
 This particolored vault of heaven is naught;
 Our sojourn in this seat of life and death
 Is but one breath, and what is that but naught?

data.marked:
O foolish one! this molded earth is naught;
 This <b>particolored</b> vault of heaven is naught;
 Our sojourn in this seat of life and death
 Is but one breath, and what is that but naught?

Elizabeth coloured.
&quot;Oh, I don&#x27;t want the doll called after me, if that is what you mean,&quot; she said, rather disdainfully.
&quot;Nonsense, <b>Lisa</b>!&quot; laughed her father, &quot;you ought to consider yourself highly honoured to have such a handsome lady as this for your namesake.&quot;

